          <mxCell id="onboarding-n" value="Password sign-up records age and consent in the same request, so it skips AgeConsentStep. Google sign-in creates the account without them, so the guard sends the user to the age step first. Forgot password (M2) reuses the OTP rules with purpose password_reset: see page 1c." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="110" y="670" width="570" height="80" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
