          <mxCell id="pw-reset-n1" value="Other devices: their access tokens die with the old token_version, and replaying a refresh token ended by revoke-all (or from an older token_version) gets 401 session_expired without revoking again, so the session started after the reset survives; reusing a rotated token still revokes all. Code TTL, attempts, resend wait and hourly cap reuse the identity otp_* keys; forgot/reset rate limits come from migrations 0011 and 0012. Wrong-code, used-code and unknown-number answers are indistinguishable." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=12;align=left;spacingLeft=6;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1255" width="1300" height="60" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
