          <object id="qr-scanapi" label="&lt;b&gt;POST /api/scans&lt;/b&gt; (deeds/_scans.py), OnboardedUser: account + IP rate limits (typed codes also per target: 20 per 15 min and 60 per day, L4) before any lookup; monthly total pre-check (429 monthly_report_limit); resolve; not self, no shared phone_history; 409 already_recognized_today or 429 pair_monthly_limit, both naming the doer (D27); plausibility: accuracy ≤ 500 m, within 40 km of Bangalore, travel ≤ 80 km/h → scan_id, scanned_at, pair_reports_remaining, month_resets_at" status="implemented" milestone="M2" source="backend/app/modules/deeds/router.py; backend/app/modules/deeds/_scans.py; backend/app/modules/deeds/_plausibility.py; backend/app/modules/deeds/_reporter_limit.py; backend/app/modules/deeds/_limits.py; backend/alembic/versions/2026_11_17_0100-0009_deeds_v4.py"><mxCell style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=10;spacing=8;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="860" y="480" width="300" height="215" as="geometry" /></mxCell></object>
